NMOF 0.36-2 is now available from CRAN (and also from
http://enricoschumann.net/R/packages/NMOF/index.htm )

Incidentally, today is also the 4th anniversary of the first CRAN
release.

The NEWS file says:

v0.36-2  (2015-10-16)

  o functions from packages other than 'base' are now explicity
    imported: 'grDevices', 'graphics', 'stats', 'utils'

v0.36-1  (2015-07-22)

  o TAopt: more informative error message when objective function
    evaluates to NA during computation of thresholds


